  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- All three packages, `CliInvoke.Core`, `CliInvoke`, and `CliInvoke.Specializations`, now ship assets for .NET 10 and .NET 11. Source builds require the .NET 10 and .NET 11 SDKs, and `global.json` pins version 11.0.100.\n        - Validation rules and environment-variable comparisons also use less memory. `RequiresExitCodeZero` reuses the same function instead of creating a new one each time. `ProcessConfiguration.Equals` compares environment variables by key instead of comparing sorted lists.\n- `AllowExceptionsIfUnexpected` no longer swallows non-cancellation failures that happen near a timeout.",
